flowchart LR
    P[Signed principal intent] --> A[Agent proposal]
    A --> G[ProofPath authority and causal checks]
    G --> E[Mock executor receipt]
    E --> O[Observed result]
    O --> W[Witness statement]
    W --> V[Offline PoCI verifier]
    V -->|valid chain| OK[ACCEPT report]
    O -->|result digest changed| V
    V -->|integrity conflict| BAD[CHALLENGE report]
